The Seahawks play three of four preseason opponents they faced[ in] 2018 with the only exception being the Denver Broncos in Week 1 at CenturyLink Field. Seattle then travels to Minnesota in Week 2 for a nationally-televised game vs. the Vikings on Sunday night[,] August 18 at 5 p.m. on FOX. The team stays on the road in Week 3 at the L.A. Chargers.
